{title: Thank You, My Jesus}
{artist: Larry Holder}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

Verse 1
1. Thank You, my Jesus, for giving to me
Life that is full, and salvation so free...
Saved by Your grace, and not by what I do;
Jesus, my Lord, I love You!

Verse 2
2. Thank You, my Jesus, for saving my soul,
Taking the pieces and making me whole.
Thank You for coming and seeing me through...
Jesus, my Lord, I love You!
